                        jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                        sling:resourceType="weekender/components/text"
                        text="&lt;p>Weekender is a group of people who spend their free days outdoors and write down what they find: trips worth taking, places worth the detour and the things we wish we had known before. We want more people to get outside more often, and to come home with a good story.&lt;/p>&#xa;"
